@* The app's own panel in BevTools: a plain component that needs nothing of Bit.BevTools, so it can be the public .razor
   component every .razor file is. It injects the app's services as any component does. *@
@inject NavigationManager Navigation

<div class="sample-support">
    <p>The app's own support panel, added through <code>BevToolsLoaderOptions.ConfigureBevTools</code>.</p>
    <dl>
        <dt>Page</dt>
        <dd>@Navigation.ToBaseRelativePath(Navigation.Uri)</dd>
    </dl>
</div>
